# Merging to main triggers a production apply, so this is change control for
# live DNS and WAF. It only *requests* reviewers until "Require review from
# Code Owners" is on for main in branch protection. Deviation detection pushes
# to main directly and needs a bypass -- see docs/14-deviation-detection.md.

*                           @rostam-sodagari

# Anything that decides what reaches Cloudflare at all, for every domain.
/.github/                   @rostam-sodagari
/cf.py                      @rostam-sodagari
/policy.yaml                @rostam-sodagari
/scripts/                   @rostam-sodagari
/modules/                   @rostam-sodagari

# Provider pinning: these lock files are what stop a plan silently picking up
# a new Cloudflare provider build.
**/.terraform.lock.hcl      @rostam-sodagari
